    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>SIDEUP&#8217;s official shipping extension for WordPress in KSA.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Easy <strong>setup</strong> and <strong>use</strong>.</li>\n<li>Well-designed dashboard for managing shipping orders.</li>\n<li>Full dashboard on <strong>our system</strong> for all details about your account.</li>\n<li>You can place your orders, print bills, and track them from the same place.</li>\n<li>Account manager for assistance and services.</li>\n<li>Designed to make your eCommerce experience easier and faster. If you have any suggestions, don&#8217;t hesitate to contact us.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Installation &amp; Configuration</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Upload the downloaded plugin files to your <code>/wp-content/plugins/sideup-shipping-ksa</code> directory, <strong>OR</strong> install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Go to Settings -&gt; Shipping and select the SIDEUP unit to configure the plugin.</li>\n<li>Add your business APIKEY from your dashboard in our system under the <strong>Integrations</strong> tab or contact your <strong>Account Manager</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First public release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "The official SIDEUP shipping plugin for WordPress in KSA.",
    "description": "<p>SIDEUP&#8217;s official shipping extension for WordPress in KSA.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Easy <strong>setup</strong> and <strong>use</strong>.</li>\n<li>Well-designed dashboard for managing shipping orders.</li>\n<li>Full dashboard on <strong>our system</strong> for all details about your account.</li>\n<li>You can place your orders, print bills, and track them from the same place.</li>\n<li>Account manager for assistance and services.</li>\n<li>Designed to make your eCommerce experience easier and faster. If you have any suggestions, don&#8217;t hesitate to contact us.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Installation &amp; Configuration</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Upload the downloaded plugin files to your <code>/wp-content/plugins/sideup-shipping-ksa</code> directory, <strong>OR</strong> install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Go to Settings -&gt; Shipping and select the SIDEUP unit to configure the plugin.</li>\n<li>Add your business APIKEY from your dashboard in our system under the <strong>Integrations</strong> tab or contact your <strong>Account Manager</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n",
